# Deny-by-default: this repo publishes the diagnostic code only.
# Manuscripts, literature PDFs, and multi-GB raster caches must never be
# committed, so nothing is tracked unless it is explicitly re-included below.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!requirements.txt

!fig3_effective_resolution.py
!r2_diagnostic.py
!make_submission_figs.py

# Rendered figures that the manuscript uses (small, worth shipping).
!figures/
figures/*
!figures/submission/
figures/submission/*
!figures/submission/*.png
!figures/submission/r2_timeseries.csv
